"""Build the GW1 minutes overlay from the research legs.

Every entry carries a written reason (CLAUDE.md rule 4: models propose, the manager
disposes, and every deviation is written down). duration_gws scopes the news: the
World Cup fitness deficit is a GW1-3 effect, not an 8-GW one — pricing a transient
as permanent is the overlay-horizon defect the backtest already paid for once.
"""
